Package: healthmlaudit
Title: Audit Binary Classification Predictions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Milly", "Wu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "125825028+millywucello@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Evaluates binary classification predictions with an explicit
    positive class and a shared input contract. Provides performance metrics,
    binned calibration plots, subgroup summaries, percentile bootstrap
    intervals, and Markdown reports. Includes synthetic example predictions
    and documented handling of missing and undefined results.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    rlang,
    yardstick (>= 1.3.1)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
LazyData: true
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/millywucello/healthmlaudit
